{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUCCUBUS ROULETTE</strong> is a tabletop Nsfw game that attempts to re-design the infamous game of <i>Buckshot roulette</i> replacing the traditional pump-action shotgun with a magic deck of cards. This extra something :v, and more importantly the different mechanics in dealing the cards compared to a shotgun offers a fresh take on the classic and deadly game of chance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339830/extras/f7d182e0b29902bdad883970061fa304.avif?t=1752103269\" width=650 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game takes place after the events of <i>Doki Doki Tri-Line Quest</i>, where the protagonist is summoned to a place that exists between everything and nothing to participate in a sacred game among succubi. An ancient god awaits\u2014will you meet with them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong>:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 15 to 20 minute playthrough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- Is not that\u00a0Immersive or\u00a0grounded as buckshot roulette but is honest work :0.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- Unscripted rounds that offer unpredictable yet controllable outcomes, with a fair amount of replay value.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0- A ruthless yet fair AI, that makes decisions based on what's on the table, rather than under it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339830/extras/96af81f39112d233cd959f58a0e68074.avif?t=1752103269\" width=650 height=104 /></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"New Queen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3339830/e56e76a7bc841c2ff76b421612e8d020cf475461.jpg"},{"name":"Coin Flip","path":"ht